  "solution": {
    "text": "We have, $\\log _{e} x+e x=0$\r\n$\\log _{e} x=-e x$\r\nSince, both the graphs intersect at only one since.\r\n<img src=\"assets\\st0017_ae0d9341b941.png\">\r\nHence, the number of real roots of equation is one"
